{"blocks":[{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんは。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"佐藤詩織です!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさーん!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"絶賛ブログ毎日更新期間中ですよ〜"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ちゃんと見に来てくれてますか〜?笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"…いつまで続くんだろう。笑\nわたし、三日坊主癖あるから、\n今回ばかりはちゃんとやりたいなって。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"20歳迎えたしね!!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これからは、雑誌の掲載の情報とか、\nはやく解禁したいもの(されるもの)あるので、随時お知らせしてきます。!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ。最近は、\nアプリで、イヤフォンつけてカラオケできるやつ入手して、家で歌ってます。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にすごい!これが。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"エコーとかちゃんとかかるし、点数採点もしてくれる、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"優秀や。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JHN2B5X6NJBWT9GJSG6F7A3F","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\nどうでもいい話〜〜☆"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"↑この、左下のマッチョくん可愛すぎませんか?笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"すごく個人的にツボです。笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ばいさ!"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"p.s.見にきてくれたみんなありがとね。はやく握手会で会いたいね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"も